          "originalContent" : "@100923804654788847953, take a trip to a hardware store and search the aisles for anything that may be used as an enclosure. You may need some creativity, but you can surely get some bigger boxes there.\nI'm using a Printrbot LC (http://printrbot.com/shop/printrbot-lc/). When I backed the Kickstarter, it was about the cheapest way to get a 3D printer. There's other inexpensive options now, but I can say I'm very satisfied with my 'bot."
